+          <action-text-attachment url="https://videos.37signals.com/fizzy/assets/images/tag-design.gif" alt="カードにタグを付けるデモ" caption="#デザイン タグを付ける" content-type="image/*" filename="tag-design.gif" presentation="gallery"></action-text-attachment>
+      - title: "さらに2つの列を作る"
